{"id":"2c3363e43798732e","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-generator.md","title":"Infinitesimal Generator of a Markov Semigroup","display":"df-generator — Infinitesimal Generator of a Markov Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generator","aliases":["58-df-generator"],"display":"df-generator — Infinitesimal Generator of a Markov Semigroup","depends_on":["[[58-df-banach-space]]","[[58-df-bounded-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generator — Infinitesimal Generator of a Markov Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\((\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span> (Banach space of real-valued functions on a state space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)\">\\(P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)\\)</span> (operator family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal X\">\\(\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal X\\)</span> (constant-one function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S\\)</span> (strongly continuous Markov-semigroup predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (generator candidate with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\subseteq\\mathcal X\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\subseteq\\mathcal X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span> (infinitesimal-generator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}markov\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)\\land P(0)=I_{\\mathcal X}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(s+t)=P(s)\\circ P(t))\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P(t),\\mathcal X,\\mathcal X)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(f\\geq0\\to P(t)(f)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(t)(\\mathbf1)=\\mathbf1)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\|P(t)(f)-f\\|=0\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}markov\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)\\land P(0)=I_{\\mathcal X}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(s+t)=P(s)\\circ P(t))\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P(t),\\mathcal X,\\mathcal X)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(f\\geq0\\to P(t)(f)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(t)(\\mathbf1)=\\mathbf1)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\|P(t)(f)-f\\|=0\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(L)=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal X:\\exists g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(L(f)=g\\leftrightarrow\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(L)=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal X:\\exists g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(L(f)=g\\leftrightarrow\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generator uses a norm limit in the Banach function space, not mere pointwise convergence.</li>\n<li>A Markov process with a strongly continuous transition semigroup induces this generator; not every Markov process has such a generator on every chosen function space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Banach}_S$ and $\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S$ (see [[58-df-banach-space]], [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Banach}_S$ and $\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S$ (see [[58-df-banach-space]], [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\subseteq\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}markov\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\mathrm{Banach}_S(\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land P:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\mathcal B(\\mathcal X)\\land P(0)=I_{\\mathcal X}\\\\&\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(s+t)=P(s)\\circ P(t))\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(P(t),\\mathcal X,\\mathcal X)\\\\&\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(f\\geq0\\to P(t)(f)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(P(t)(\\mathbf1)=\\mathbf1)\\\\&\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\|P(t)(f)-f\\|=0\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generator} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generator}_S(L,P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MarkovSemigroup}_S(P,\\mathcal X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(L)=\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal X:\\exists g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{dom}(L)\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal X\\;\\left(L(f)=g\\leftrightarrow\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\|\\frac{P(t)(f)-f}{t}-g\\right\\|=0\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":2332,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-581","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-generator.md|58-df-generator]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["ef59807ad934771f","2ad9c248fe18df37"]}